cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "sail-env: A JAX Simulator of J/70 Fleet Racing for Reinforcement Learning"
abstract: >-
  sail_env simulates one-design keelboat races (J/70) from the start sequence to the finish: an ORC
  polar with speed dynamics, the racing rules that govern interaction between boats (right of way,
  contact, mark-room, penalty turns), wind shadow, oscillating shifts and line bias. It provides solo
  and 5-boat start and race tasks with a functional, jit/vmap-compatible JAX API, baselines, bundled
  PPO policies, a reference PPO implementation and a browser version verified against the simulator.
authors:
